WEBVTT

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:46.960
[inhaling and exhaling deeply]

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:50.160
[male] OK... Here we go. Focus.

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:53.600
Speed. I am speed.

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:55.200
[cars whizzing past]

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:58.000
One winner, 42 losers.

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:00.680
I eat losers for breakfast.

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:02.680
[car accelerating]

00:01:02.760 --> 00:01:04.200
Breakfast.

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:06.360
Wait, maybe I
should have had breakfast.

00:01:06.440 --> 00:01:10.160
A little breck-y could be good for me.
No, no, no, stay focused. Speed.

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:11.760
[cars whizzing]

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:14.080
I'm faster than fast.
Quicker than quick.

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:15.760
I am lightning!

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:16.840
[pounding on door]

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:19.200
[male] Hey, Lightning! You ready?

00:01:19.240 --> 00:01:20.760
[♪ Sheryl Crow: Real Gone]

00:01:20.840 --> 00:01:24.000
Oh, yeah. Lightning's ready

00:01:24.040 --> 00:01:26.560
[engine revving]

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:44.000
[engine revs]

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:45.440
[crowd cheers]

00:02:02.240 --> 00:02:03.360
Ka-chow!

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:04.680
[cars zooming]

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:26.080
[cars whooshing]

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:46.320
[both scream]

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:50.480
[all cheer]

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:52.560
Get your antenna balls here!

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:01.320
Go, Lightnin'!

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:05.360
- Whoo!
- You got that right, slick. [whistles]

00:03:05.440 --> 00:03:06.680
[air wrench whirring]

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:20.880
Uh! [screams]

00:03:26.960 --> 00:03:28.200
[engine revs]

00:03:31.320 --> 00:03:34.160
- [male] Welcome back to the Dinoco 400.
- [crowd cheers]

00:03:34.240 --> 00:03:37.880
I'm Bob Cutlass, here
with my good friend, Darrell Cartrip.

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:40.960
We're midway through what may
be an historic day for racing.

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:43.040
Bob, my oil pressure's
through the roof.

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:46.720
If this gets more exciting, they're
gonna have to tow me outta the booth!

00:03:46.800 --> 00:03:47.840
Right, Darrell.

00:03:47.920 --> 00:03:50.560
[Bob] Three cars are tied
for the season points lead,

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:52.720
heading into the final race
of the season.

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:57.560
And the winner of this race will win
the season title and the Piston Cup.

00:03:57.640 --> 00:03:59.360
Does The King, Strip Weathers,

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:01.840
have one more victory in him
before retirement?

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:04.480
[Darrell] He's been Dinoco's golden boy
for years!

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:06.760
Can he win them one last Piston Cup?

00:04:06.840 --> 00:04:10.200
[Bob] And, as always, in the
second place spot we find Chick Hicks.

00:04:10.240 --> 00:04:12.800
He's been chasing
that tailfin his entire career.

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:15.040
[Darrell] Chick thought
this was his year.

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:17.880
His chance to finally emerge
from The King's shadow.

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:22.000
But the last thing he expected was...
Lightning McQueen!

00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:24.720
[Bob] You know, I don't think
anybody expected this.

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:27.400
The rookie sensation
came into the season unknown.

00:04:27.480 --> 00:04:28.960
But everyone knows him now.

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:33.120
[Darrell] Will he be the first rookie
to win a Piston Cup and land Dinoco?

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:35.760
[Bob] The legend, the runner-up,
and the rookie!

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:38.720
Three cars, one champion!

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:43.760
[breaks screeching]

00:04:50.920 --> 00:04:52.400
No you don't.

00:04:55.080 --> 00:04:57.080
- [chuckling]
- Hey!

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:03.080
- [tires squealing]
- [crowd booing]

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:05.960
What a ride!

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:07.320
[chuckling]

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:09.600
Go get 'em, McQueen!
Go get 'em!

00:05:13.400 --> 00:05:15.240
[female] I love you, Lightning!

00:05:15.280 --> 00:05:17.920
- Dinoco is all mine.
- [screaming]

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:19.960
[Darrell] Trouble, turn three!

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:23.280
- Get through that, McQueen.
- [Bob] Huge crash behind the leaders!

00:05:23.320 --> 00:05:24.320
[crowd gasps]

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:29.000
[screaming]

00:05:34.120 --> 00:05:35.120
[giggling]

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:37.760
- [grunts]
- [gasps]

00:05:39.640 --> 00:05:41.880
[both screaming]

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:48.000
[Bob] Wait a second, Darrell.
McQueen is in the wreckage.

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:50.920
[Darrell] There's no way the rookie
can make it through!

00:05:50.960 --> 00:05:52.240
Not in one piece, that is.

00:06:01.760 --> 00:06:03.920
[exhaling]

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:08.520
Yeah!

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:10.560
Lightning! Oh!

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:14.960
[Darrell] Look at that!
McQueen made it through!

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:17.520
[Bob] A spectacular move
by Lightning McQueen!

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:19.680
Yeah! Ka-chow!

00:06:19.760 --> 00:06:23.000
McQueen! McQueen! McQueen!
McQueen! McQueen! McQueen!

00:06:23.080 --> 00:06:26.040
Yeah, McQueen! Ka-chow! [honking]

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:28.360
[Bob] While everyone
heads into the pits,

00:06:28.440 --> 00:06:30.160
McQueen stays out to take the lead!

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:33.280
Don't take me out, coach.
I can still race!

00:06:33.360 --> 00:06:36.080
[air wrench whirring]

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:40.480
[chuckling] What do you think?
A thing of beauty.

00:06:40.520 --> 00:06:42.480
- McQueen made it!
- [Chick] What?

00:06:42.520 --> 00:06:43.600
He's not pitting!

00:06:43.680 --> 00:06:46.800
You gotta get me out there!
Let's go! Get me back out there!

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:48.640
McQueen's not going into the pits!

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:52.280
[Darrell] The rookie fired his
crew chief. The third this season!

00:06:52.360 --> 00:06:54.680
- [Bob] Says he likes working alone.
- Go, go!

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:56.960
Looks like Chick
got caught up in the pits.

00:06:57.040 --> 00:07:00.400
Yeah, after a stop like that,
he's got a lot of ground to make up.

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:02.880
Get ready, boys,
we're coming to the restart!

00:07:05.720 --> 00:07:08.720
[crowd cheers]

